.TH NN-EXTRACT 1 "2026" "nn 0.1.0" "NN Manual"
.SH NAME
nn-extract \- extract tensors, weights, or subgraphs
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nn extract [options] <model>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Write a tensor as npy or a subgraph as ONNX.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-tensor NAME
Tensor name.
.TP
.B \-\-from NODE
Subgraph start.
.TP
.B \-\-to NODE
Subgraph end.
.TP
.B \-o, \-\-output FILE
Output path.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 success.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
nn extract model.onnx --tensor conv1.weight -o conv1.npy
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
nn-tensors(1), nn-optimize(1)
